OL,3,CRecord 230 people cross Channel to UK
OL,4,Cin single small boat
OL,6,FThe government has condemned the
OL,7,F"reckless and dangerous" tactics used
OL,8,Fby people smugglers after a record 230
OL,9,Fmigrants arrived after crossing the
OL,10,FChannel to the UK in a single boat.
OL,12,FThe number breaks the previous record
OL,13,Ffrom July when 165 people successfully
OL,14,Fmade the crossing.
OL,16,FThe boat left France overnight,
OL,17,Farriving in Dover in the early hours
OL,18,Fof Monday.
