OL,3,CRecord 230 people cross Channel to UK
OL,4,Cin single small boat
OL,6,FA large deflated dinghy was pictured
OL,7,Fby the Press Association on the
OL,8,Fquayside at the Border Security
OL,9,FCommand compound in Dover.
OL,11,FPeople smugglers have been increasing
OL,12,Fthe number of migrants crammed into
OL,13,Fboats.
OL,15,FA dinghy carrying 173 people headed
OL,16,Ffor the UK capsized in the Channel
OL,17,Fafter its engine caught fire earlier
OL,18,Fthis month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
