OL,3,CRecord 230 people cross Channel to UK
OL,4,Cin single small boat
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FA Home Office spokesperson said: "This
OL,12,Flatest incident demonstrates the
OL,13,Freckless and dangerous tactics
OL,14,Femployed by the criminal gangs
OL,15,Ffacilitating these crossings, who
OL,16,Fcontinue to put lives at risk by
OL,17,Fcramming ever greater numbers of
OL,18,Fpeople onto unseaworthy vessels.
OL,26,@sD@bOU
