OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786468726
OL,3,CRecord 230 people cross Channel to UK
OL,4,Cin single small boat
OL,6,F"We are making progress, with the
OL,7,Fnumber of small boat crossings down
OL,8,Fthis year and the lowest number
OL,9,Frecorded for the month of July since
OL,10,F2020.
OL,12,F"But we must go further, which is why
OL,13,Fwe have signed a payment-by-results
OL,14,Fdeal with the French to put 40% more
OL,15,Fboots on the ground on French beaches."
OL,17,FResponding on X, Reform UK leader
OL,18,FNigel Farage said: "At 2.30am this
OL,19,Fmorning a boat carrying 230 people was
OL,20,Ftaken into Dover.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@gO]zD@TOU
