PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786468726
OL,3,CRecord 230 people cross Channel to UK
OL,4,Cin single small boat
OL,6,F"This is a record number in a single
OL,7,Fvessel.
OL,9,F"It's yet more proof that this illegal
OL,10,Finvasion is a national security
OL,11,Femergency."
OL,13,FSome 258 migrants arrived in the UK in
OL,14,Ffour boats on Saturday, according to
OL,15,FHome Office figures.But the number of
OL,16,Foverall arrivals for 2026 has dropped
OL,17,Fcompared with last year.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUsD@KO]
